{
    "title": "Nuki Smart Lock",
    "description": "\u2605\u2605\u2605 Explore the smart home universe with Nuki \u2605\u2605\u2605\r\n\r\nA small upgrade to your door lock, making life so much easier. With Nuki and your smartphone, you can easily retrofit your door lock for smart access. Nuki Smart Lock is mounted on the inside of your existing door lock and ready to be used within 3 minutes without any further assistance. No screws, no drills.\r\n\r\nHere is what Nuki can do for you:\r\n\u2022 Turns your smartphone into a smart key.\r\n\u2022 Auto-Unlock automatically unlocks the door as you approach.\r\n\u2022 Share access codes with friends & loved-ones easily via SMS/Whatsapp right from the Nuki app.\r\n\u2022 Keep an eye on the status of your door lock via the activity log - even from afar. \r\n\r\nTurn your Wear OS watch into your key\r\n\u2022 With the Nuki app you can also open your door via your Wear OS smartwatch.\r\n\u2022 Within Bluetooth range of your Nuki device, you can open your door directly with your watch.\r\n\u2022 Do you have a Wear OS smartwatch with internet access? All your Nuki devices can now be controlled remotely with your watch. \r\n\u2022 Are you using a smartwatch without internet access? If you have your smartphone with you, you can also control your devices remotely from your watch. Locking actions are sent from the watch to your Nuki device via the connected smartphone. \r\n\u2022 With the help of tiles and complications, the watch offers the same locking actions that are visible in the Nuki smartphone app by simply tapping on the respective device.\r\n\r\nOrder your Nuki Smart Lock directly in the Nuki Online Shop: https://shop.nuki.io/\r\nDo the installation check at www.nuki.io/check and find out if your door lock is compatible.\r\n\r\nYour benefits with Nuki:\r\n\r\nSmart - Nuki unlocks your door automatically when you come home and locks it again when you leave. Your phone stays in your pocket.\r\n\r\nSimple - Nuki Smart Lock is mounted on the inside of your existing door lock and ready to be used within 3 minutes without any further assistance. No screws, no drills.\r\n\r\nSecure - Stay in control of your Nuki Smart Lock by checking the status on your smartphone anytime and by managing access permissions for your friends and loved-ones.\r\n\r\nWorks With Nuki \r\nWorks-With-Nuki-certified doors now have Nuki technology directly integrated. This means you can benefit from the entire Nuki ecosystem and easily connect your Nuki Smart Door to a whole host of smart home systems. \r\nThe Nuki Smart Door is compatible with the following motorised locking systems: CISA DOMO Connexa and KFV Genius.\r\n\r\nInstallation requirements for Nuki Smart Lock:\r\n\u2022 Bluetooth Smart Ready phone (Bluetooth 4.0 and higher)\r\n\u2022 Operating temperature: 10\u201340 \u00b0C\r\n\u2022 Designed for indoor use only\r\n\u2022 Cylinder with emergency and danger function\r\n\r\n-------------------------\r\n\r\nYou can find more information on our website at https://nuki.io and on our social media channels.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2605\u2605\u2605 Explore the smart home universe with Nuki \u2605\u2605\u2605<br><br>A small upgrade to your door lock, making life so much easier. With Nuki and your smartphone, you can easily retrofit your door lock for smart access. Nuki Smart Lock is mounted on the inside of your existing door lock and ready to be used within 3 minutes without any further assistance. No screws, no drills.<br><br>Here is what Nuki can do for you:<br>\u2022 Turns your smartphone into a smart key.<br>\u2022 Auto-Unlock automatically unlocks the door as you approach.<br>\u2022 Share access codes with friends &amp; loved-ones easily via SMS/Whatsapp right from the Nuki app.<br>\u2022 Keep an eye on the status of your door lock via the activity log - even from afar. <br><br>Turn your Wear OS watch into your key<br>\u2022 With the Nuki app you can also open your door via your Wear OS smartwatch.<br>\u2022 Within Bluetooth range of your Nuki device, you can open your door directly with your watch.<br>\u2022 Do you have a Wear OS smartwatch with internet access? All your Nuki devices can now be controlled remotely with your watch. <br>\u2022 Are you using a smartwatch without internet access? If you have your smartphone with you, you can also control your devices remotely from your watch. Locking actions are sent from the watch to your Nuki device via the connected smartphone. <br>\u2022 With the help of tiles and complications, the watch offers the same locking actions that are visible in the Nuki smartphone app by simply tapping on the respective device.<br><br>Order your Nuki Smart Lock directly in the Nuki Online Shop: https://shop.nuki.io/<br>Do the installation check at www.nuki.io/check and find out if your door lock is compatible.<br><br>Your benefits with Nuki:<br><br>Smart - Nuki unlocks your door automatically when you come home and locks it again when you leave. Your phone stays in your pocket.<br><br>Simple - Nuki Smart Lock is mounted on the inside of your existing door lock and ready to be used within 3 minutes without any further assistance. No screws, no drills.<br><br>Secure - Stay in control of your Nuki Smart Lock by checking the status on your smartphone anytime and by managing access permissions for your friends and loved-ones.<br><br>Works With Nuki <br>Works-With-Nuki-certified doors now have Nuki technology directly integrated. This means you can benefit from the entire Nuki ecosystem and easily connect your Nuki Smart Door to a whole host of smart home systems. <br>The Nuki Smart Door is compatible with the following motorised locking systems: CISA DOMO Connexa and KFV Genius.<br><br>Installation requirements for Nuki Smart Lock:<br>\u2022 Bluetooth Smart Ready phone (Bluetooth 4.0 and higher)<br>\u2022 Operating temperature: 10\u201340 \u00b0C<br>\u2022 Designed for indoor use only<br>\u2022 Cylinder with emergency and danger function<br><br>-------------------------<br><br>You can find more information on our website at https://nuki.io and on our social media channels.",
